{"id":"56f078003b4a5a13","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-yamabe-problem.md","title":"Relative Yamabe Variational Datum","display":"df-yamabe-problem — Relative Yamabe Variational Datum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-yamabe-problem","aliases":["58-df-yamabe-problem"],"display":"df-yamabe-problem — Relative Yamabe Variational Datum","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-yamabe-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-yamabe-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-yamabe-problem — Relative Yamabe Variational Datum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md\">../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathcal D,q,u,Y\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathcal D,q,u,Y\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle\\)</span> packages the geometric dimension and three supplied analytic functionals.</li>\n<li>Intended meanings are\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(u)=\\int_M|\\nabla_gu|^2\\,dV_g\">\\(\\mathcal E(u)=\\int_M|\\nabla_gu|^2\\,dV_g\\)</span>,\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_2(u)=\\int_MR_gu^2\\,dV_g\">\\(\\mathcal R_2(u)=\\int_MR_gu^2\\,dV_g\\)</span>, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N(u)=\\int_M|u|^{2n/(n-2)}\\,dV_g\">\\(\\mathcal N(u)=\\int_M|u|^{2n/(n-2)}\\,dV_g\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{YamabeSolution}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{YamabeSolution}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land n\\geq3\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^M\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal E,W,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal R_2,W,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal N,W,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\forall u\\in W\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\mathcal N(u)&gt;0)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land n\\geq3\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^M\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal E,W,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal R_2,W,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal N,W,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\forall u\\in W\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\mathcal N(u)&gt;0)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(q,u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle\n\\land u\\in W\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land q=\n\\frac{\\frac{4(n-1)}{n-2}\\mathcal E(u)+\\mathcal R_2(u)}\n{\\mathcal N(u)^{(n-2)/n}}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(q,u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle\n\\land u\\in W\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land q=\n\\frac{\\frac{4(n-1)}{n-2}\\mathcal E(u)+\\mathcal R_2(u)}\n{\\mathcal N(u)^{(n-2)/n}}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}constant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S(Y,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\n\\land\nY=\\inf\\{q\\in\\mathbb R:\\exists u\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(q,u,M,\\mathcal D)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}constant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S(Y,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\n\\land\nY=\\inf\\{q\\in\\mathbb R:\\exists u\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(q,u,M,\\mathcal D)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}solution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeSolution}_S(u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nu\\in\\mathbb R^M\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(u(x)&gt;0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists Y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S(Y,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(Y,u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}solution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeSolution}_S(u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nu\\in\\mathbb R^M\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(u(x)&gt;0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists Y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S(Y,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(Y,u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate is explicitly relative to the supplied Dirichlet-energy, scalar-curvature-energy, and critical-norm functionals. It no longer hides <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^1(M)\">\\(H^1(M)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_g\">\\(\\nabla_g\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_g\">\\(R_g\\)</span>, or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dV_g\">\\(dV_g\\)</span> behind unbound notation.</li>\n<li>When the three functionals are obtained from a certified closed Riemannian manifold, a positive minimizer yields the usual constant-scalar-curvature conformal metric <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{4/(n-2)}g\">\\(u^{4/(n-2)}g\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Existence of such a minimizer is the Yamabe theorem and is not built into this definition atom.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Aubin, Some Nonlinear Problems in Riemannian Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathcal D,q,u,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E(u)=\\int_M|\\nabla_gu|^2\\,dV_g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_2(u)=\\int_MR_gu^2\\,dV_g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N(u)=\\int_M|u|^{2n/(n-2)}\\,dV_g","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{YamabeSolution}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle\\\\\n&{}\\land n\\in\\omega\\land n\\geq3\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\\\\n&{}\\land W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^M\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal E,W,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal R_2,W,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal N,W,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\n\\land\\forall u\\in W\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\mathcal N(u)>0)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(q,u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle n,g,W,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal R_2,\\mathcal N\\rangle\n\\land u\\in W\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land q=\n\\frac{\\frac{4(n-1)}{n-2}\\mathcal E(u)+\\mathcal R_2(u)}\n{\\mathcal N(u)^{(n-2)/n}}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}constant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S(Y,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{YamabeDatum}_S(\\mathcal D,M)\n\\land\nY=\\inf\\{q\\in\\mathbb R:\\exists u\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(q,u,M,\\mathcal D)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yamabe\\text{-}solution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{YamabeSolution}_S(u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nu\\in\\mathbb R^M\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(u(x)>0)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists Y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{YamabeConstant}_S(Y,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{YamabeFunctional}_S(Y,u,M,\\mathcal D)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"H^1(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla_g","display":false},{"tex":"R_g","display":false},{"tex":"dV_g","display":false},{"tex":"u^{4/(n-2)}g","display":false}],"bytes":3364,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1399","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-yamabe-problem.md|58-df-yamabe-problem]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["71fe0dc4c8613e69","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","36d7463d215be751"]}